      "date": "2026-11-21 18:56:19.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(4 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nSome concerns, see inline comments. The main one is that the global FIFO ties every ZFS OSD on the node to the slowest pool. The zfs_dirty_data_max detection also doesn't fire with any current ZFS release.",
